{% comment %}
  Mobile side gutter for the default collection / search product grid.
  Rendered from layout/theme.liquid.

  Horizon's main-collection grid carries no inline padding at any level, so on mobile
  the cards run flush to the screen edge. At desktop the grid is held in by
  --page-width, which is why this only shows below 750px. The full_width_on_mobile
  setting is not the lever — its class has no effect here (see the P30 brief).

  main-collection.liquid is upstream and must not be edited, so the gutter is applied
  from here.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .main-collection-grid {
      padding-inline: var(--page-margin);
    }
  }
</style>
